INSERT INTO "ReferenceCard" ("id", "kind", "symbol", "name", "formulaLatex", "valueUnit", "description", "variables", "purposeExamTip", "subject", "topicId", "subtopicId", "subtopicTag", "dimensionless", "status", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
SELECT gen_random_uuid()::text, 'formula', '$V_{r,NL} = \frac{V_s}{\cos\beta\ell}$', 'Ferranti Effect', '$V_{r,NL} = \frac{V_s}{|A|} = \frac{V_s}{\cos\beta\ell}\ (\text{lossless}) \approx V_s\left(1 + \frac{\omega^2LC\ell^2}{2}\right)$', '$\text{V}$', 'An open or lightly loaded long line has a HIGHER voltage at the far end.', '[{"symbol":"$V_s$","meaning":"sending-end voltage","unit":"$\\text{V}$"},{"symbol":"$\\beta$","meaning":"phase constant, ω√(LC)","unit":"$\\text{rad/m}$"},{"symbol":"$\\ell$","meaning":"line length","unit":"$\\text{m}$"}]'::jsonb, 'The rise grows with the square of length; shunt reactors keep it down.', 'EE', t."id", (SELECT s."id" FROM "SyllabusSubtopic" s JOIN "Topic" t ON t."id" = s."topicId" WHERE t."name" = 'Power System Analysis' AND t."subject" = 'EE' AND s."normKey" = 'short, medium and long lines' AND s."active"), NULL, false, 'PENDING', now(), now()
FROM "Topic" t WHERE t."name" = 'Power System Analysis' AND t."subject" = 'EE'
ON CONFLICT ("kind", "subject", "name") DO NOTHING;
